Package: gloBFPr
Type: Package
Title: Building Analysis Using Global Building Height Datasets
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Xiaohao",
      family = "Yang",
      email = "xiaohaoy111@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    ))
Description: Automated access and analysis of multidimensional building profile 
    in cities. The package provides tools to access, search, and download global 
    3D building footprint datasets.
    It includes functions to retrieve building height tiles, compute a range of 
    multidimensional building morphology metrics, assess environmental context 
    (e.g., greenery accessibility), and support shadow/radiation analysis.
